{"content_sha256":"914a365efc17b68c9df688b8077ce1300fed0722732dd4466b54897db9c937ee","kind":"question","payload":{"accepted_answers":["well-known"],"correct_sense_id":"lx:sense:4ce7d12e-49f7-4135-a134-3aac1dc30b60","correct_usage_ids":["lx:usage:07c3df26-12fb-484b-bfa6-efd11f402277"],"distractor_rationales":[],"family_id":"lx:family:11836ebe-8aa2-4c4c-b37d-501c1f057bb9","options":[],"post_answer_feedback":{"answer":"well-known","explanation":"廣為人知的可用 well-known；這個複合形容詞由副詞 well 和過去分詞 known 組成。此處置於 actor 前，依題目指定使用一般連字號，寫作 well-known。單字形式 famous、renowned、celebrated、famed 不符合兩部分的作答格式；well known 不符合本題名詞前的連字號格式。"},"primary_target_id":"lx:target:bf7b049b-a730-4601-bbb5-66aca9719be1","provenance_refs":["provenance/batch-1/3751e6fa-6dcc-460f-9bb0-66d681bf6b2a-r1"],"split":"train","status":"candidate","stem":"Translate the adjective in parentheses to complete the sentence. Write only a lowercase compound adjective consisting of an adverb and a past participle, joined with a single ordinary hyphen (-); do not use a one-word synonym: The museum displayed a portrait of a ___ (廣為人知的) actor whose face appeared in newspapers around the world.","tested_ability":"writing"},"record_id":"lx:question:3751e6fa-6dcc-460f-9bb0-66d681bf6b2a","revision":3,"schema":"lexvane.content.v1"}
{"content_sha256":"61205dc08c8d9fdab22d9761ac4d021f85a71983ff5b8b6d3054e58bc9c5dbfa","kind":"question","payload":{"accepted_answers":["information"],"correct_sense_id":"lx:sense:3b4b445f-4e73-4163-bfe4-91d14615380c","correct_usage_ids":["lx:usage:2aab3654-b856-4c3d-a8e5-8fa5003a36ea"],"distractor_rationales":[],"family_id":"lx:family:ff120e1f-cc5f-42d7-9615-6ed170086aeb","options":[],"post_answer_feedback":{"answer":"information","explanation":"information 表示資訊，是不可數名詞。新碼頭的地址與接駁方式，是安排登船所需的進一步資訊，因此寫 further information。依題面的書寫規則，答案為完整、全小寫的 information；不採縮寫。"},"primary_target_id":"lx:target:d9b72d9f-9c59-4f79-8a6f-de0c7359d3ec","provenance_refs":["provenance/check-batch-2/22-question-r1"],"split":"check","status":"candidate","stem":"渡輪公司把登船處移到另一個碼頭，卻尚未公布新碼頭的地址與接駁方式。你要帶同行者準時抵達，因此寫信詢問：Could you send me further ___ about the new boarding arrangements? 空格須表達你所需的「資訊」。請填一個完整的英文不可數名詞，只寫全小寫的完整單字，不用縮寫，不加標點或空白。","tested_ability":"writing"},"record_id":"lx:question:6d4352b7-7571-41b8-b9f8-ab9c8a91a456","revision":5,"schema":"lexvane.content.v1"}
{"content_sha256":"9e71ec2b013f347b39b33aefa5f72348325b4462c4cfb606336b5c78aaba4872","kind":"question","payload":{"accepted_answers":["information"],"correct_sense_id":"lx:sense:3b4b445f-4e73-4163-bfe4-91d14615380c","correct_usage_ids":["lx:usage:2aab3654-b856-4c3d-a8e5-8fa5003a36ea"],"distractor_rationales":[],"family_id":"lx:family:1b890ab3-e278-4293-bdd9-720142df4bc1","options":[],"post_answer_feedback":{"answer":"information","explanation":"information 是資訊。這裡填寫美國《資訊自由法》的正式英文名稱 Freedom of Information Act 中的名詞；作答形式要求全小寫，故寫 information。這是固定名稱的語境產出，不是利用 inform、字首或字母數推答案。"},"primary_target_id":"lx:target:d9b72d9f-9c59-4f79-8a6f-de0c7359d3ec","provenance_refs":["provenance/batch-author-2/22-question-r1"],"split":"train","status":"candidate","stem":"For a civics assignment, Dana used the U.S. Freedom of ___ Act to request a government report that had not been published. Complete the official English title of 美國《資訊自由法》. Write only the missing noun in lowercase, without abbreviations or punctuation.","tested_ability":"writing"},"record_id":"lx:question:dd2d4bbe-0818-4403-b178-e8661a3a762c","revision":3,"schema":"lexvane.content.v1"}
{"content_sha256":"3d4fa8d67cbb11b8321950a92f5bbab5a67f90eb1311fba0b873028cab3f5c92","kind":"question","payload":{"accepted_answers":["well-known"],"correct_sense_id":"lx:sense:4ce7d12e-49f7-4135-a134-3aac1dc30b60","correct_usage_ids":["lx:usage:07c3df26-12fb-484b-bfa6-efd11f402277"],"distractor_rationales":[],"family_id":"lx:family:e9966a26-751b-458c-84c0-65ee6aa091a4","options":[],"post_answer_feedback":{"answer":"well-known","explanation":"well-known 表示廣為人知的。原句的 well known 放在連綴動詞 is 後面；本題保留這兩個詞，改放在名詞 melody 前作複合形容詞，標準寫法須加連字號，因此答案是 well-known。只寫 known 會少了原句的 well；寫成 well known 則沒有依照題面要求完成名詞前的連字號形式。其他同義表達即使意思相近，也不符合題面明訂的『保留原句兩個詞』改寫要求。本題是寫作題，沒有選項或干擾選項，因此 distractor_rationales 維持空陣列。"},"primary_target_id":"lx:target:bf7b049b-a730-4601-bbb5-66aca9719be1","provenance_refs":["provenance/check-batch-1/e0c837c6-9845-4394-bdc5-2fc6b7647d08-r1"],"split":"check","status":"candidate","stem":"句子改寫：The melody is well known throughout the island. 請保留原句表示『廣為人知的』的兩個英文詞，將它們改成放在名詞前的複合形容詞，完成：They played a ___ melody. 只填改寫後的形容詞；使用全小寫，依標準拼法在兩詞之間加上連字號，不加其他標點。這是保留原詞的句子改寫，不是另選同義詞的翻譯題。","tested_ability":"writing"},"record_id":"lx:question:e0c837c6-9845-4394-bdc5-2fc6b7647d08","revision":7,"schema":"lexvane.content.v1"}
{"content_sha256":"406f687c07d5f99e43eb1c3a664a85f4f294055e7469d4a988cecfca0c56aa99","kind":"teaching","payload":{"examples":[{"english":"A well-known artist painted this wall.","zh_hant":"一位著名藝術家畫了這面牆。"},{"english":"The artist is well known in our town.","zh_hant":"這位藝術家在我們鎮上很有名。"}],"explanation_zh_hant":"well-known 放在名詞前作複合形容詞時，用連字號把兩部分接起來，例如 a well-known artist。放在 be 後通常寫成 well known，例如 The artist is well known。這是位置相關的寫法，不要在所有位置都機械式加連字號；此寫作目標練習名詞前的形式。","primary_target_id":"lx:target:bf7b049b-a730-4601-bbb5-66aca9719be1","pronunciation_text":"well-known /ˌwelˈnoʊn/；known 的 k 不發音。","provenance_refs":["provenance/batch-1/07c3df26-12fb-484b-bfa6-efd11f402277-r1"],"source_refs":[{"operations":["reference"],"source_id":"S01"}],"status":"candidate","tested_ability":"writing","usage":"a well-known artist；The artist is well known."},"record_id":"lx:usage:07c3df26-12fb-484b-bfa6-efd11f402277","revision":1,"schema":"lexvane.content.v1"}
{"content_sha256":"d0a796051452ce717f286134c57c0d17c1ac8b11abc5d540af2e4344677fa805","kind":"teaching","payload":{"examples":[{"english":"The website provides useful information about opening hours.","zh_hant":"這個網站提供關於開放時間的實用資訊。"}],"explanation_zh_hant":"information 是不可數名詞，說 some information 或 useful information，不說 an information 或 informations。要數一則資訊，可說 a piece of information；兩則是 two pieces of information。這個產出練習要求自行寫出英文詞，而非從選項辨認。","primary_target_id":"lx:target:d9b72d9f-9c59-4f79-8a6f-de0c7359d3ec","pronunciation_text":"/ˌɪnfərˈmeɪʃən/","provenance_refs":["provenance/batch-author-2/22-teaching-r1"],"source_refs":[{"operations":["reference"],"source_id":"S01"}],"status":"candidate","tested_ability":"writing","usage":"useful information; a piece of information"},"record_id":"lx:usage:2aab3654-b856-4c3d-a8e5-8fa5003a36ea","revision":1,"schema":"lexvane.content.v1"}
